---
title:    "Demand-driven Search in Functional Logic Programs"
citation: ""
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/publications/reports/LIFO-98-08.html"
date:     1998-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
